Function Requirements:

FR1 — Sampling
The circuit shall accept an 8-bit input sample when Valid_In is asserted.

FR2 — Window Storage
The circuit shall maintain a sliding window containing the four most recent
valid input samples.

FR3 — Average Calculation
The circuit shall calculate the arithmetic average of the four samples:

        Average = (x[n] + x[n-1] + x[n-2] + x[n-3]) / 4

FR4 — Conditional Update
The sample window and associated calculation state shall be updated only
when Valid_In is asserted.

FR5 — Output Validity
The circuit shall indicate that the output is valid only after four valid
samples have been received.

FR6 — Reset
The circuit shall initialize its internal state to a known state when reset
is asserted.
---
Resource Constraints: 
RC1 — Area
The implementation is targeted at approximately 200–280 standard cells
after synthesis.
